# The main scenario: a typical game, from orbit to an Ark leaving a developed planet.
#
# `spec/scenarios.md`: there is one main scenario and it touches everything a typical game
# uses. It is the foundation, and it is vetted by hand. A mechanic that only appears in an
# unusual situation belongs in a scenario of its own - so nothing here starves and nothing
# is lost to nature, and both get scenarios of their own once this one satisfies its reader.
#
# Every line is a command. There is no other way for the state to move, so this file is a
# complete account of how the game got where `scenario/expected/play.4x` says it is.
#
# **Storage is the constraint now** - `S-44`. A territory declares no capacity for a
# resource; it holds what its stores hold, and a store holds ten. An extractor holds
# nothing, so what is produced goes into a store, is spent the turn it is made, or is lost
# when that turn ends. A founding leaves a food store and a metal store and no energy store,
# which is why energy is the resource this game has to build for.

# Turn 1. The Ark lands on territory 1 and becomes the ground: a garrison, two citizens, a
# farm, a mine, and somewhere to put what each of them digs.
{deploy ark territory:1}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:metal}
{end turn}

# Turn 2. Four citizens. The farm makes four and the store holds ten, so the second farm can
# wait; the mine pays for a second store first, because metal with nowhere to go is lost.
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:metal}
{create labor territory:1}
{build extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{build store territory:1 resource:food}
{end turn}

# Turn 3. Two farms, and four citizens - so four labor, and four things this turn can do.
# The second mine waits a turn for the population to pay for it.
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:metal}
{create labor territory:1}
{build store territory:1 resource:metal}
{end turn}

# Turn 4. The last farm and the first well. Energy has nowhere to go until it has a store,
# which is the shape `S-44` gave the middle of this game.
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:metal}
{create labor territory:1}
{build extractor territory:1 resource:metal}
{create labor territory:1}
{build extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{build extractor territory:1 resource:energy}
{create labor territory:1}
{build store territory:1 resource:energy}
{end turn}

# Turn 5. Everything the ground has room for is built, bar the last mine and the last wells.
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:metal}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:metal}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:energy}
{create labor territory:1}
{build extractor territory:1 resource:metal}
{create labor territory:1}
{build extractor territory:1 resource:energy}
{end turn}

# Turn 6. Twelve of each a turn, and a pioneer costs three metal and six energy.
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:metal}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:metal}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:metal}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:energy}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:energy}
{create labor territory:1}
{build extractor territory:1 resource:energy}
{create labor territory:1}
{build store territory:1 resource:energy}
{end turn}

# Turn 7. The pioneer, and the last stores this territory will need.
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:metal}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:metal}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:metal}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:energy}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:energy}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:energy}
{create labor territory:1}
{build store territory:1 resource:metal}
{create labor territory:1}
{produce pioneer territory:1}
{end turn}

# Turn 8. The pioneer crosses into territory 2 and becomes it. `P-214`: the player says which
# recipe this is, because arriving on unclaimed ground and arriving on your own are two
# recipes, and the model no longer works out from the ground which was meant.
{found by land territory:2}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:energy}
{create labor territory:1}
{build yard territory:1}
{create labor territory:2}
{work extractor territory:2 resource:food}
{end turn}

# Turn 9. The Ark. Three metal and twelve energy against a Yard, and the new ground feeds
# itself on the turn after the one it was claimed.
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:energy}
{create labor territory:1}
{produce ark territory:1}
{create labor territory:2}
{work extractor territory:2 resource:food}

# The Ark crosses to territory 2 before it leaves, which is the only `move` in this file -
# ground already yours, which is the whole difference between the two recipes.
{move ark territory:2}
{end turn}

# Turn 10. Moving exhausts a unit, so the Ark leaves on the turn after the one it crossed on.
# The farms are worked first, as always: a population that gathers nothing this turn starves
# at the end of it, whatever else is going on.
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:1}
{work extractor territory:1 resource:food}
{create labor territory:2}
{work extractor territory:2 resource:food}
{launch ark}
{end turn}
